>نص بسيط</entry
><entry
>1</entry
></row>
<row
><entry
>الفقرة</entry
><entry
>2</entry
></row>
<row
><entry
>اختيار</entry
><entry
>3</entry
></row>
<row
><entry
>خانة تأشير</entry
><entry
>4</entry
></row>
<row
><entry
>عدد</entry
><entry
>6</entry
></row>
<row
